---
import HomeLayout from '../../layouts/HomeLayout.astro';
import { beanReviews } from '../../data/bean-reviews';
import '../../styles/review.css';
import '../../styles/beans.css';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---
<HomeLayout title="Coffee Bean Reviews: Choose by Roast, Origin and Freshness | Coffeedant" description="Research-led coffee bean reviews with attributed flavor notes, changing blend details, brew fit, roast-date guidance and dated US value." canonicalPath="/coffee-beans/">
  <main id="main-content" class="bean-index">
    <section class="bean-index-hero"><div class="review-shell"><p class="review-overline">Coffee bean reviews</p><h1>Know what is in the bag.</h1><p>Start with the roaster’s current description, then check the roast date, changing origins, brew fit and how quickly you will use it. We attribute flavor notes and leave a coffee unrated when we have not tasted it.</p></div></section>
    <section class="review-shell bean-index-list" aria-labelledby="bean-index-list-title"><p class="review-overline">Current research-led reviews</p><h2 id="bean-index-list-title">Choose a coffee for your routine</h2><div class="bean-index-grid">{beanReviews.map((review) => <article><img src={review.image} alt={review.imageAlt} width="360" height="360" loading="lazy" /><div><p>{review.roaster} · {review.market}</p><h3><a href={`${base}${review.slug.replace(/^\//, '')}`}>{review.coffee}</a></h3><p>{review.verdict}</p><small>Updated <time datetime={review.updated}>{review.updated}</time> · {review.price} at {review.priceChecked}</small></div></article>)}</div></section>
    <section class="review-shell bean-index-guide" aria-labelledby="bean-index-guide-title"><h2 id="bean-index-guide-title">Three checks before a larger bag</h2><div><article><span>01</span><h3>Exact coffee</h3><p>A year-round name can contain changing lots. Check the roaster’s current component record and the bag’s roast date.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Your brew</h3><p>Filter ratios do not transfer directly to espresso. Choose a coffee and grinder you can dial in on your actual equipment.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Freshness budget</h3><p>A low per-ounce price matters only if you finish the bag while you still enjoy its flavor.</p></article></div><p>Choosing a darker coffee? <a href={`${base}coffee-beans/best-dark-roast-coffee-beans/`}>Compare our dark-roast buying picks</a>. Brewing the same bag as espresso and drip? <a href={`${base}coffee-beans/best-coffee-beans-for-espresso-and-drip/`}>Compare dual-method picks</a>. Need a grinder? <a href={`${base}grinder/`}>Compare current grinder reviews</a>.</p></section>
    <section class="review-shell bean-index-guide" aria-labelledby="milk-guide-link-title"><p class="review-overline">New buying guide · October 16, 2026</p><h2 id="milk-guide-link-title">Beans for the milk drink you make</h2><p>Compare four exact whole-bean coffees for a large latte, bright cappuccino, coffee with cream and decaf milk drink. <a href={base + 'coffee-beans/best-coffee-beans-for-milk-drinks/'}>Read the milk-drinks buying guide</a>.</p></section>
    <section class="review-shell bean-index-guide" aria-labelledby="press-guide-link-title"><p class="review-overline">New buying guide · October 21, 2026</p><h2 id="press-guide-link-title">Beans for the French press cup you make</h2><p>Compare four exact whole-bean coffees for dark press with milk, medium fruit, cream-friendly filter and decaf. <a href={base + 'coffee-beans/best-coffee-beans-for-french-press/'}>Read the French press bean guide</a>.</p></section>
    <section class="review-shell bean-index-guide" aria-labelledby="decaf-guide-link-title"><p class="review-overline">Buying guide · October 15, 2026</p><h2 id="decaf-guide-link-title">Decaf for the way you brew</h2><p>Compare five exact whole-bean decafs by espresso, drip, mixed-method and milk-drink use, with named processing and dated US prices. <a href={base + 'coffee-beans/best-decaf-coffee-beans-by-brew-method/'}>Read the decaf buying guide</a>.</p></section>
  </main>
</HomeLayout>
